  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/92946971/0.52.1</id>
    <updated>2026-08-01T18:18:19Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/tag/0.52.1"/>
    <title>Version 0.52.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete the closing handshake on server-initiated WebSocket closes in the &lt;code&gt;websockets-sansio&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;wsproto&lt;/code&gt; implementations, waiting for the client&#39;s close reply with a 10 second timeout instead of resetting the connection (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5032438926&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3053&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3053/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3053&quot;&gt;#3053&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add missing write flow control to the &lt;code&gt;websockets-sansio&lt;/code&gt; implementation, preventing data truncation on server-initiated closes with large in-flight payloads (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5017142837&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3048&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3048/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3048&quot;&gt;#3048&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle connection loss while a WebSocket write is waiting on backpressure (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5019853658&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3050&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3050/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3050&quot;&gt;#3050&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove duplicate &lt;code&gt;Content-Type&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Content-Length&lt;/code&gt; headers from WebSocket denial responses on the &lt;code&gt;websockets-sansio&lt;/code&gt; implementation, and deliver non-UTF-8 denial bodies intact (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4995536082&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3041&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3041/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3041&quot;&gt;#3041&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.52.0...0.52.1&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;0.52.0...0.52.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <author>
