  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/92946971/0.52.0</id>
    <updated>2026-07-29T07:53:32Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/tag/0.52.0"/>
    <title>Version 0.52.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;This release adds an experimental HTTP/1.1 implementation backed by &lt;a href=&quot;https://zttp.marcelotryle.com/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;zttp&lt;/a&gt;, a sans-IO HTTP parser I&#39;ve been developing on the side: a core written in Zig, with bindings to Python. It has been running under a fuzzer for some weeks now, and has been through multiple rounds of security auditing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is still &lt;strong&gt;experimental&lt;/strong&gt;, so don&#39;t put it in front of production traffic yet. Try it with &lt;code&gt;--http zttp&lt;/code&gt;, and please send any feedback to the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues&quot;&gt;issue tracker&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add an experimental &lt;code&gt;zttp&lt;/code&gt; HTTP/1.1 implementation, selectable with &lt;code&gt;--http zttp&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4611819120&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2979&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/2979/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/2979&quot;&gt;#2979&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep non-ASCII WebSocket request headers intact with websockets 17.0, which encodes them with ISO-8859-1 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4917959610&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3036&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3036/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3036&quot;&gt;#3036&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.51.0...0.52.0&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;0.51.0...0.52.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>Kludex</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/92946971/0.51.0</id>
    <updated>2026-07-08T10:58:00Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/tag/0.51.0"/>
    <title>Version 0.51.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime reloads by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Kludex/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex&quot;&gt;@Kludex&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4827669023&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025&quot;&gt;#3025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove colorama from the standard extra by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Kludex/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex&quot;&gt;@Kludex&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4836647560&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027&quot;&gt;#3027&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;0.50.2...0.51.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
